  "description": "APPLICATION FOR A LAWFUL DEVELOPMENT CERTIFICATE IN RESPECT OF THE PROPOSED ERECTION OF A REAR DORMER ROOF EXTENSION WITH 4 x FRONT ROOF LIGHTS",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Enlargement of a dwelling house (Class B) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- The rear dormer roof extension would consist of the enlargement of a dwelling house\r\nwithin the meaning of Class B of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the Town &amp;amp; Country\r\nPlanning (General Permitted Development)&amp;nbsp;\r\n(England) Order 2015 &quot;the Order&quot; and would comply with the\r\ndevelopment tolerances set out in said Class B. The operation would therefore\r\nhave been granted planning permission by Article 3 of the Order.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Alteration to the roof of the dwelling house (Class C)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; - The installation of front rooflights would consist of any other alteration to the roof of the\r\ndwelling house within the meaning of Class C of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the\r\nTown &amp;amp; Country Planning (General Permitted Development)&amp;nbsp; (England) Order 2015 &quot;the Order&quot;\r\nand would comply with the development tolerances set out in said Class C. The\r\noperation would therefore have been granted planning permission by Article 3 of\r\nthe Order.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
